From 691f8f9e3f9527b688bf376dca7b0718c5131f0c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mesh-LLM CI <ci@mesh-llm.local>
Date: Tue, 15 Sep 2026 00:28:31 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 038/113] models: accept legacy conversion metadata in pinned
 family artifacts

- minimax-m3: optional MSA indexer metadata and weights; dense fallback
- llama-kv-cache-msa: placeholder indexer cache when the indexer is absent
- mimo2: sliding-window pattern may cover the MTP blocks as well
- granite-switch: accept the ungrouped adapter metadata spelling
- granite-swa: support separate shared-expert gate/up projections
---
 src/llama-kv-cache-msa.cpp    |  4 +++-
 src/models/granite-swa.cpp    | 36 ++++++++++++++++++++++---------
 src/models/granite-switch.cpp | 18 ++++++++++++----
 src/models/mimo2.cpp          |  4 +++-
 src/models/minimax-m3.cpp     | 40 +++++++++++++++++++++++------------
 5 files changed, 73 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/llama-kv-cache-msa.cpp b/src/llama-kv-cache-msa.cpp
index 55ef286ca..9664a6260 100644
--- a/src/llama-kv-cache-msa.cpp
